1
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:02,033
[PING] June!

2
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:04,567
June!

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,067
June!

4
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:09,667
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

5
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:12,200
[PHONE RINGING]

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,233
Why aren't you answering?
June, where are you?

7
00:00:14,633 --> 00:00:15,600
June!

8
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:18,167
- June!
- What's wrong?

9
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:20,000
[PING WHISPERING] Come here!

10
00:00:22,067 --> 00:00:23,567
- [POT SHATTERS]
- [JUNE SCREAMS] Ack!

11
00:00:29,267 --> 00:00:30,600
Listen carefully, June.

12
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,133
We need to call the police
immediately!

13
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:38,267
Huh?

14
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:40,733
[STUTTERING] Wh-- wh--

15
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:42,600
wh-- why?

16
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:45,600
What happened?

17
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,067
Uh... huh?!

18
00:00:48,633 --> 00:00:49,567
Huh?

19
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:50,700
Oh!

20
00:00:52,467 --> 00:00:54,333
[ZIA GRUNTS] I hate it!

21
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:56,233
That woman's always
getting in my way!

22
00:00:56,233 --> 00:00:57,733
I have to eliminate
that gold digger

23
00:00:57,733 --> 00:00:59,500
to get the old man's money.

24
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:00,767
Attorney!

25
00:01:01,233 --> 00:01:02,533
Wrap it up already!

26
00:01:02,533 --> 00:01:04,100
My brother already knows
everything!

27
00:01:04,367 --> 00:01:06,167
Then I have no choice
but to push

28
00:01:06,167 --> 00:01:09,367
the case against you
so you'll rot in jail!

29
00:01:11,133 --> 00:01:12,733
I can finally return this
back to them.

30
00:01:13,133 --> 00:01:15,100
You can't use me
against my brother anymore!

31
00:01:15,667 --> 00:01:17,233
Then I'll just get rid of Ping!

32
00:01:17,233 --> 00:01:18,700
I'm sick of you two!

33
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:23,667
- [TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]
- [PANTING]

34
00:01:23,667 --> 00:01:25,100
- [GRUNTS]
- [CAR DOOR OPENS]

35
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,400
[SIGHS]

36
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,500
[CAR DOOR CLOSES]

37
00:01:29,067 --> 00:01:30,033
[PHONE BEEPS]

38
00:01:30,233 --> 00:01:31,533
[PHONE RINGS]

39
00:01:31,533 --> 00:01:32,733
Hello, Sheryn?

40
00:01:33,467 --> 00:01:35,300
Are we ready for our next move?

41
00:01:35,733 --> 00:01:39,233
Bring me to that person
who will knock June down.

42
00:01:39,633 --> 00:01:40,733
[GRUNTS]

43
00:01:41,567 --> 00:01:42,567
[PHONE BEEPS]

44
00:01:42,567 --> 00:01:49,533
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
